# Routing Architecture

Use modern React Router 7 declarative routing patterns.

Prefer:
- layout routes
- nested routes
- route composition

Avoid deeply coupled routing logic.

---

# Pages

Pages should:
- orchestrate features
- compose components

Avoid placing low-level UI or business logic directly inside pages.

---

# Navigation

Use:
- Link
- NavLink

for UI navigation.

Use useNavigate only for:
- redirects
- post-submit navigation
- programmatic flows

Avoid using useNavigate for normal navigation links.

---

# Route Structure

Prefer scalable route structure:

router/
pages/
layouts/

Keep routing configuration centralized.

---

# URL State

Use URL params and search params intentionally.

Prefer search params for:
- filters
- sorting
- pagination
- search state

---

# Layouts

Use layout routes for:
- shared navigation
- shared wrappers
- shared page structure

Avoid duplicating layouts across pages.